---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Secure | Virtual Concept Technologies"
  description="Cybersecurity, network security, application security and AI security."
>
  <main>
    <section class="bg-slate-950 text-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-8 lg:py-32">

        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-400">
          VCT / Secure
        </p>

        <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">
          Build with security in mind.
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
          Cybersecurity capabilities focused on protecting networks,
          applications and AI-powered systems.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">

          <a href="/secure/cybersecurity/" class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 p-8 transition hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-sm">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-400">01</p>
            <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">
              Cybersecurity
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-400">
              Practical cybersecurity capabilities for modern digital
              environments.
            </p>
          </a>

          <a href="/secure/network-security/" class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 p-8 transition hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-sm">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-400">02</p>
            <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">
              Network Security
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-400">
              Network protection, secure infrastructure and security monitoring.
            </p>
          </a>

          <a href="/secure/app-security/" class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 p-8 transition hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-sm">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-400">03</p>
            <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">
              App Security
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-400">
              Security considerations throughout the application development
              lifecycle.
            </p>
          </a>

          <a href="/secure/ai-security/" class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 p-8 transition hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-sm">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-400">04</p>
            <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">
              AI Security
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-400">
              Security considerations for applications and systems using
              artificial intelligence.
            </p>
          </a>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
